                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I do not recommend Dota 2 because I value my mental health, my time, and my will to live.  You queue up expecting fun, but 40 minutes later, you're arguing with a guy who thinks he's the next Miracle- while going 0/10. Your teammates blame you, the enemy team calls you trash, and somehow your own tower is gone before you even finish buying your items.\r\n\r\nThe game isn't free-to-play. It's free-to-suffer. You don't play Dota 2; Dota 2 plays with your emotions. You enter as a normal human being and leave questioning your life choices. 10/10 game, 0/10 mental stability. Would not recommend unless you hate peace.",
